1
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,840
What do you mean?

3
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:53,280
Thanks for the other night.

4
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:55,560
I waited in line just to get you
that viral milk tea.

5
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,480
Just showing my respect.

6
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:59,440
Watch what you say.
People might get the wrong idea.

7
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,600
Let them.

8
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:03,400
As long as you don't misunderstand
my total devotion to you.

9
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,760
Scram.

10
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,640
Fine, I'll go then.

11
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,440
I just came back to grab my car anyway.

12
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,639
I'll be at the Blue Bay
project site all week.

13
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:12,040
Don't miss me too much.

14
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:14,680
You take care of yourself.
You're still heartbroken.

15
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:17,240
There are cranes
and debris everywhere on site.

16
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,760
Don't get distracted and hurt yourself.

17
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,600
Hearing that actually made me feel better.

18
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,600
You should go.

19
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,600
I'm off.

20
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,640
-Remember to drink it.
-Thanks.

21
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,800
Wanna drink it?

22
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,560
Here. Zhao Heng bought it.
I haven't touched it.

23
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,280
What's wrong?

24
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,880
Nothing. Didn't sleep well last night.

25
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,080
I get it.

26
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,920
So what is going on
with you and Ye Xinzhi?

27
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,360
Nothing.

28
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,280
Don't lie to me.

29
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:19,080
You definitely told him
you and Yang Rui broke up.

30
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,280
How did he react?

31
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:24,280
Missy, do you really need to know?

32
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,640
Of course I do. What else would I ask?

33
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,880
-Mr. Pi, I have a meeting soon.
-Well…

34
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,720
I'll send you that file a bit later.

35
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,480
Yang Rui.

36
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,720
Um, let's start the meeting.

37
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:04,160
During the meeting earlier,
I saw you sitting with Xu Chi.

38
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,720
Why didn't you two have lunch together?

39
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,920
She went to the bank.

40
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,480
Shu told me she's under
a lot of pressure in your team

41
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,200
because you guys
work together too efficiently.

42
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,200
Sometimes, you're like one person.

43
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:18,240
Just ask what you want to know.
No need to beat around the bush.

44
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,880
You're too guarded with me.

45
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,120
I just want to know

46
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,680
how Xu Chi is doing
since she moved to your team.

47
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:24,960
She's doing great.

48
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,240
Fully focused on work.
Not missing you at all.

49
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,800
I used to think you two
weren't that close.

50
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,920
Didn't expect you to defend her like that.

51
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,440
We're not close.

52
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:39,600
So, next time
you have a question like that,

53
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,800
don't bother asking me.

54
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:44,560
No way. Is this Zhao Heng and Xu Chi?

55
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:46,520
I just saw it on Moments.

56
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:49,880
My classmate's bank
had a team dinner last Saturday night.

57
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,120
Such a big scoop.

58
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:53,520
I had to go gossip right away.

59
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,960
My classmate said
there was even juicier stuff.

60
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:59,640
Zhao Heng confessed to Xu Chi on the spot!

61
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,880
Wasn't Zhao Heng pursuing Bu Tianna?

62
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,040
What's the gossip?

63
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:09,080
Share it with me too.

64
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,400
Well.

65
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,920
So juicy.

66
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:22,960
If you two have
this much time on your hands,

67
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:25,720
maybe think about
how to get promoted, okay?

68
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,640
Sorry about that.

69
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,520
Have some ice water. Cool down.

70
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:49,160
Zhao Heng used to drive Xu Chi
to Celestial all the time.

71
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,120
People at Celestial told me.

72
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:53,200
Back then, Xu Chi
and I were still together,

73
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,720
but she'd rather take Zhao Heng's car.

74
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,280
Seriously, what is wrong with you?

75
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,800
Talking trash about your ex
behind her back? No wonder she dumped you!

76
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:07,840
Bu Tianna, don't think
you're the only one who gets to be sad.

77
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,520
I got cheated on,

78
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,560
but just because she's your friend,

79
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,320
I'm not even allowed to complain?

80
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,840
My feelings for Xu Chi were real.

81
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,000
Why can't I say it?

82
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,800
Of course you can.

83
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,920
There are plenty of people here.
Say it wherever you want.

84
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,120
Just not in front of me.

85
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,320
Quit staring!

86
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,320
What a temper.

87
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:42,880
<i>Zhao Heng confessed to Xu Chi on the spot!</i>

88
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:48,320
<i>Zhao Heng used to drive Xu Chi</i>
<i>to Celestial all the time.</i>

89
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,600
People at Celestial told me.

90
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:52,440
<i>Back then, Xu Chi</i>
<i>and I were still together.</i>

91
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:54,120
But she'd rather take Zhao Heng's car.

92
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,280
<i>Wang. Wang.</i>

93
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,040
<i>Is Mr. Zhao from Maxmise with you?</i>

94
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,360
I'm here. What's up?

95
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,560
<i>There's a female colleague</i>
<i>looking for you.</i>

96
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,240
<i>She showed up at the site in all white.</i>

97
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:14,720
<i>Looked like she was in a rush.</i>
<i>Just grabbed a hard hat and came in.</i>

98
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:22,720
What are you doing here?

99
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:29,600
I came to apologize.

100
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,920
Didn't you say you wanted an apology?

101
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,240
I was wrong.

102
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,680
I'm sorry.

103
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,240
I shouldn't have called you shameless.

104
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,840
And I shouldn't have insulted
your parents.

105
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:43,320
It's all on me. Is this enough?

106
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,360
What do you mean?

107
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:50,160
Still not enough? Fine.

108
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,760
What I mean is, can we go back

109
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:57,240
to how things were?

110
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:59,040
You want to hit on me? I'll play along.

111
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,040
You want to use me as a stepping stone?

112
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:03,480
I'll play along with that too.
I'll hook you up with connections.

113
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,520
But can you leave Xu Chi alone?

114
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,720
Just come at me.

115
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:09,000
Don't hurt her to get back at me, okay?

116
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,120
What are you even talking about?

117
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,240
That's still not enough?

118
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,360
Let me tell you,
I don't have that much patience.

119
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,520
Xu Chi is too naive.

120
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,920
She broke up with Yang Rui
for Ye Xinzhi on a whim, and now look.

121
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,640
Ye Xinzhi left her hanging.
She's already a mess.

122
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:25,440
She can't handle all your sweet talk.

123
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:27,240
I know exactly
how powerful your tricks are.

124
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,680
You're way too much.

125
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,000
One day you're driving her around.

126
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:31,480
The next day you're buying
gifts and milk tea.

127
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,600
Then it's all sweet talk.

128
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,919
Isn't it money you're after?

129
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,039
You just want to use her and hurt her!

130
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,720
It's not like that. Calm down.

131
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,280
This is me being calm!

132
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,280
The whole company knows
you two were drinking together.

133
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:44,360
Even people at Celestial Insurance know.

134
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:48,280
Zhao Heng, you don't have to go
this far just to get back at me!

135
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:18,120
What is wrong with you? Are you crazy?

136
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,920
Didn't you tell me to come at you?

137
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:28,400
Are you calm now?

138
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,920
Can you listen to me now?

139
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:35,800
I don't know what you heard
or saw out there,

140
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:37,400
or what you misunderstood.

141
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:39,400
I just want to say one thing.

142
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:42,520
Xu Chi and I are just friends.
Like buddies.

143
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,280
I've called her Ms. Xu,
and I've called her Chi.

144
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,120
That Saturday, I was in a bad mood
after arguing with you.

145
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,360
I ran into her at the office.
I asked her to drink with me.

146
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,520
Then I drank too much.

147
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:53,120
She dumped me in a cab

148
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,240
and sent me home.

149
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:57,240
Then the next day, I wanted to thank her,
so I bought her a milk tea.

150
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,920
-That's it.
-Really?

151
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,000
Yes.

152
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,720
Then…

153
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,440
Then… I'm fine now.

154
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,080
But I'm not.

155
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,560
I've realized you really get me.

156
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:18,120
A gorgeous woman standing right here.

157
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:21,160
She's got money,
a fancy car, and a big house.

158
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:24,160
You think I'd just change my life goals
over a fight with you?

159
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:26,920
-Do I look like that kind of guy?
-Okay, okay. I get it.

160
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:30,440
How can you just take advantage
and walk away?

161
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,960
Hey, aren't you trying to pursue me?

162
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:41,240
Then you have to get used
to my mood swings

163
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,640
and being used and tossed aside. Got it?

164
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,680
I'm really happy you came to see me today.

165
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:05,000
God, what a dump this place is.

166
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,000
Tianna!

167
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,520
<i>That was way too short.</i>

168
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,120
<i>Next time, let's make it longer.</i>

169
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:20,520
<i>And let's try it without the hard hats.</i>

170
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,200
-Hello?
-Where are you?

171
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:43,160
How come you're not at the office?
And you didn't get back to me on WeChat.

172
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,880
What's wrong?

173
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:45,760
Something happened
with the Celestial project.

174
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:48,280
<i>Their board secretary and legal team</i>
<i>just went straight to Mr. Pi.</i>

175
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,560
No idea what they said.

176
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,440
But Mr. Pi came out and announced
the whole project is on hold.

177
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,200
Xu Chi. Xu Chi.

178
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,320
Sha Sha wants you in her office.
Right now.

179
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,720
The recording is standard procedure.

180
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,360
Hope you don't mind.

181
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:11,160
Also, the Compliance Department will take

182
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:13,160
your work laptop for the investigation.

183
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:16,840
Under your contract with the company,
all of this is legal and reasonable.

184
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:19,040
Investigation? Is something wrong with me?

185
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,440
Everyone on the Celestial project team
is being investigated.

186
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:22,720
I need to ask you a few questions.

187
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:26,200
First, why did you apply

188
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,880
to transfer out of
the Celestial project's IT team?

189
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:32,200
Because Yang Rui and I broke up.

190
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:36,520
We both felt it wasn't appropriate
to stay in the same team.

191
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:39,560
-But he's the team lead, so I…
-Why did you two break up?

192
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:42,200
Why did you fight before the breakup?

193
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:47,920
These all touch on private matters.
You don't have to answer.

194
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,560
But that could very likely

195
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:52,000
affect how the company
views this situation.

196
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,640
We just weren't compatible. No fights.

197
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:57,320
Actually, we weren't together that long.

198
00:12:57,400 --> 00:13:00,240
Once we realized it wasn't working,
we talked it out pretty quickly.

199
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,280
Okay.

200
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:04,320
Was the detailed reform plan

201
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,520
for Celestial's IT Department done by you?

202
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,640
The draft was.

203
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:10,240
About 60% of the work.

204
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:12,000
The other 40% was done by Yang Rui.

205
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:16,880
Is there something wrong with that plan?

206
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:22,160
Highlight everything you worked on.

207
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,320
Try to recall as thoroughly as you can

208
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:26,080
because this will be cross-checked

209
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:28,080
against your emails
and the investigation results

210
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:29,400
on Yang Rui.

211
00:13:40,280 --> 00:13:42,440
Also, you need to specify how many times

212
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:44,840
you met with Mr. Sun

213
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:47,080
and what you discussed.

214
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,320
<i>Meet me on the rooftop.</i>

215
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,200
Did they call you in?

216
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:30,760
Talked for ten minutes.

217
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,080
Lu Le talked to me.

218
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:35,880
She just asked about
your general work situation in our team.

219
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:38,960
When you didn't come out for so long,
I figured something went wrong.

220
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:40,280
So I asked around

221
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:42,880
with people at Celestial
and some of my elders,

222
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:45,520
-and I put together a rough theory.
-What is it?

223
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,120
MA KE might have made a shady deal

224
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:51,320
with Director Peng
from Celestial's IT Department.

225
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:54,280
The plan we made changed

226
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:56,120
the system architecture
for Celestial's IT Department,

227
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,360
but their IT Department

228
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:59,640
doesn't have the ability
to do it on their own.

229
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,560
They'd have to outsource.

230
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:02,880
And that outsourcing
is tied to Director Peng.

231
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,000
But the one who talked to me
and Yang Rui that day was Mr. Sun.

232
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:09,400
Mr. Sun is the Deputy Director.
Director Peng is the one in charge.

233
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:12,080
That day, Director Peng
had a last-minute business trip,

234
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:13,480
so Mr. Sun filled in for him.

235
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,600
<i>Our SOA works perfectly fine,</i>

236
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:17,480
<i>and you want us</i>
<i>to just switch to microservices?</i>

237
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,400
And get it done in three months?

238
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:19,960
Do you have any idea
how much work that is?

239
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:21,600
This transformation has to happen.

240
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:22,680
So please make sure

241
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:24,680
to fully cooperate with us
on the redevelopment.

242
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:26,480
Ma Ke said to put it on hold.

243
00:15:26,560 --> 00:15:27,640
He'll handle it.

244
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:29,560
Can you not go off on your own like this?

245
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:31,120
-Yang Rui?
-You figured it out too?

246
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,240
Be honest with me.

247
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:39,520
Were you involved in this?
How much do you know?

248
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:42,200
-I don't know anything.
-It's not too late if you tell me now.

249
00:15:42,280 --> 00:15:44,080
Even if I have to beg my dad,

250
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:45,280
I'd know

251
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,520
how to get you out.

252
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:48,600
How could I possibly
do something like that?

253
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:50,880
Ye Xinzhi drilled it into me
so many times.

254
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,240
No conflicts of interest. No kickbacks.

255
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,800
That's the most basic code
of conduct for consultants.

256
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,400
I could never do something like that.

257
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,480
Good.

258
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,080
I heard Mr. Sun kicked up a fuss

259
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:05,200
because your team's project
was way too ridiculous.

260
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:06,560
Higher-ups just wanted
to calm things down,

261
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:07,680
so they had
the Integrity &amp; Compliance Department

262
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:08,960
go through the motions.

263
00:16:09,040 --> 00:16:10,720
But after just two days,

264
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:12,880
they found the problem
between Ma Ke and Director Peng.

265
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:15,640
No wonder Yang Rui
told me to keep quiet during the pitch,

266
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:17,560
acted so pushy

267
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:19,680
when presenting the plan,
and set such a tight deadline.

268
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:21,240
By the way,

269
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,760
Mr. Sun didn't agree back then.

270
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:23,880
And Ma Ke called Yang Rui,

271
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,760
told me to stay out of it,
and said he'd handle it.

272
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:28,840
Let me be blunt.

273
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:32,720
Yang Rui broke up with you so early.
Didn't that

274
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:35,320
raise any flags?

275
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,800
He must've known that after you broke up,

276
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:39,560
you wouldn't be on the same team anymore.

277
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,160
Because I thought

278
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:46,360
the IT architecture overhaul plan
was way too ridiculous.

279
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,920
I sided with Mr. Sun.

280
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,640
So they felt I was in the way.

281
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:53,160
Yang Rui is Ma Ke's right-hand man.

282
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:55,560
You're the one who told me that.

283
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:58,920
No way.

284
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,840
Yang Rui can't be that kind of person.

285
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:05,839
<i>This kind of thing happens.</i>
<i>I've been through it too.</i>

286
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:07,680
That's just how Ma Ke is.

287
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:09,400
He used to be pretty good at his job.

288
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:11,480
But over the last couple of years,
with more going on at home,

289
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:13,079
his focus hasn't been on work.

290
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,079
He often takes credit for our work.

291
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,040
But he's good at networking.

292
00:17:17,119 --> 00:17:20,599
Most of Celestial Insurance's projects
came from him drinking with clients.

293
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:24,000
Wait. Yang Rui told me

294
00:17:24,079 --> 00:17:25,599
Ma Ke's been short on money
these past few years.

295
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,880
That's why he drank himself sick
to land the Celestial deal.

296
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,480
So…

297
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:31,520
I'll go clear the air with Sha Sha.

298
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:32,800
Wait.

299
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,000
Okay, alright.

300
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:38,480
Calm down. Don't do anything right now.

301
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:41,760
Plus, this is a joint investigation
by Celestial and Maxmise.

302
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,840
Both are top-tier companies.
You won't be wrongly accused.

303
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:46,240
But I saw the news before.

304
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:47,880
In 2014, Anxinda had a similar case.

305
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:50,000
Several people ended up
criminally detained.

306
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:51,000
Do you think Yang Rui…

307
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:53,400
Okay, forget about him.

308
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:55,120
All that matters is that you're okay.

309
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:57,080
Mr. Pi and Sha Sha
both thought highly of you before.

310
00:17:57,160 --> 00:18:00,200
Once they confirm
you had nothing to do with this,

311
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:01,480
they'll definitely protect you.

312
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:04,360
But this has gotten so big.

313
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:06,840
And insurance is the most
sensitive sector in finance.

314
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:09,320
If they can't get to the bottom of it,
will they sacrifice the innocent

315
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:11,200
to protect their reputation?

316
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:12,480
I'm just a junior analyst.

317
00:18:12,560 --> 00:18:15,440
To them, I'm not irreplaceable.

318
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:31,240
BUSINESS NEEDS ASSESSMENT PHASE
APRIL 6–8

319
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:34,960
CELESTIAL INSURANCE

320
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:49,000
I think Xu Chi's proposal is clean.

321
00:19:57,600 --> 00:20:00,840
I hope you understand how serious this is.

322
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:04,920
Celestial is getting ready
to bring in economic crimes investigators.

323
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:06,920
I have a clear conscience.

324
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:08,520
I'll fully cooperate
with any investigation.

325
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:11,560
Investigations take time.

326
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:13,920
So the company wants you
to cooperate with an off-site audit.

327
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:15,720
What does that mean?

328
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:17,080
Am I getting fired?

329
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:18,840
No, just off-site.

330
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,600
To make sure the investigation
isn't interfered with,

331
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:23,440
you'll need to take a temporary leave.

332
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,640
If you're proven innocent,

333
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:26,840
you'll come back to work.

334
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:31,480
Besides me,

335
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:32,920
will there be anyone else
on leave for the audit?

336
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:35,520
Yang Rui, Ma Ke, and me.

337
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:41,160
Because you were suddenly brought in by me

338
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,760
long after the project started.

339
00:20:42,840 --> 00:20:44,040
That doesn't make sense.

340
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,640
Sorry I dragged you into this.

341
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,040
Then…

342
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:55,880
How long will I be on leave?

343
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,280
About a month for now.

344
00:20:58,200 --> 00:21:00,800
People from Integrity &amp; Compliance
are already waiting for you at your desk.

345
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,280
After you finish with them,
you'd better leave the office right away.

346
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:05,000
Don't worry.

347
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:07,680
During the audit, your salary
and benefits won't be affected.

348
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:11,280
Okay.

349
00:21:21,800 --> 00:21:23,600
Ms. Sha, do you believe me?

350
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:27,600
I only believe in facts.

351
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:43,280
-How did it go?
-How did it go?

352
00:21:50,080 --> 00:21:52,400
I'm on immediate leave. Off-site audit.

353
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:58,640
Even Sha Sha got dragged

354
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:01,240
into this because of me.

355
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:02,880
It's fine.

356
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:04,440
Listen.

357
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:07,320
Just take your leave.
I'll keep an eye on things here.

358
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,040
I won't let you get screwed over.

359
00:22:09,120 --> 00:22:11,400
So even you think I'm doomed now?

360
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:16,200
No. It's alright. Don't overthink it.

361
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:24,720
And your badge.

362
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:28,080
-Can she come back?
-God knows.

363
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:32,160
I used to be jealous of her.

364
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:34,680
After all, she got promoted
the fastest out of all of us.

365
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:36,240
And now…

366
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:01,760
What are you…?

367
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:03,800
Lin, you're back at work.

368
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:07,960
Welcome back.

369
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:18,200
Just stay put at the office for now.

370
00:23:18,280 --> 00:23:19,360
I'll go.

371
00:23:28,440 --> 00:23:29,400
Chi.

372
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:32,440
Come grace my crappy car
with your presence.

373
00:23:35,120 --> 00:23:36,080
Let's go.

374
00:23:53,280 --> 00:23:55,400
Hey, stop being upset.

375
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:57,320
If it were me, I'd be over the moon.

376
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:58,800
Come on, paid leave.

377
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:01,640
A once-in-a-lifetime chance.
Make the most of it.

378
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:03,440
When you make partner someday,

379
00:24:03,520 --> 00:24:04,960
you can brag to your team

380
00:24:05,040 --> 00:24:07,120
about this rare break.

381
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:11,360
You don't need to comfort me.

382
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,480
I can handle it.

383
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:15,920
It's not that far anyway.
You really didn't have to drive me.

384
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:18,360
It's not just for you.

385
00:24:19,560 --> 00:24:22,280
Tianna will be glad to hear about this.

386
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:26,640
I just saw you two whispering together.

387
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:28,160
Didn't look like fighting at all.

388
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,080
Come clean.

389
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:31,640
What happened when I wasn't around?

390
00:24:33,040 --> 00:24:34,160
Nothing.

391
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:37,400
Anyway, thanks.

392
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:38,520
You're thanking me?

393
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:41,160
You remember that night
I got drunk, right?

394
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:42,200
You put me in a cab.

395
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:44,720
Someone took a photo.

396
00:24:44,800 --> 00:24:46,960
Tianna saw it, and immediately drove

397
00:24:47,040 --> 00:24:49,200
to the construction site
in her all-white outfit.

398
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:51,560
She grilled me.
"Why did you make a move on her?"

399
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:54,760
She told me to stop messing with you
and to come at her instead.

400
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:57,600
So you two are the real couple,

401
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:59,680
and I'm just some cheap side piece?

402
00:25:02,040 --> 00:25:02,880
Glad you know.

403
00:25:04,800 --> 00:25:06,200
Hey, what are you talking about?

404
00:25:07,280 --> 00:25:12,280
What I mean is, she was actually jealous.
She's too stubborn to admit it.

405
00:25:12,360 --> 00:25:14,920
So she used you as her excuse
to come talk to me.

406
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:17,680
After I explained everything to her,
it was all good.

407
00:25:17,760 --> 00:25:18,960
She was happy.

408
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:20,160
Even though

409
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:22,320
I still don't have an official title,
the second you got into trouble,

410
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:24,400
she called me right away

411
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:25,720
to figure out what to do.

412
00:25:26,760 --> 00:25:27,840
Got it.

413
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:30,280
Then keep at it. Make it official soon.

414
00:25:31,800 --> 00:25:33,000
You bet.

415
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:56,200
<i>I saw you at the café on Saturday.</i>

416
00:25:56,280 --> 00:25:58,440
Can you explain why you were there?

417
00:25:58,520 --> 00:26:00,320
And he was there too.

418
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:03,280
The two of us were having coffee
and afternoon tea together.

419
00:26:04,520 --> 00:26:10,520
Are you two deeply involved
in our company's business dealings?

420
00:26:10,600 --> 00:26:14,800
Tell me when and where you met Mr. Sun.

421
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:16,120
<i>The more detailed, the better.</i>

422
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:17,520
<i>Have you worked together before?</i>

423
00:26:17,600 --> 00:26:20,160
<i>Why does the IT Department</i>
<i>want to replace the entire system?</i>

424
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:21,760
<i>Give me a proper explanation.</i>

425
00:26:21,840 --> 00:26:23,160
<i>Be honest with me.</i>

426
00:26:23,680 --> 00:26:25,080
<i>Were you involved in this?</i>

427
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:26,080
How much do you know?

428
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,720
I only believe in facts.

429
00:26:28,520 --> 00:26:30,600
I want to hear your honest answer.

430
00:26:31,200 --> 00:26:32,800
<i>Can you explain why you were there?</i>

431
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:34,320
<i>Were you involved in this?</i>

432
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:36,880
<i>Why does the IT Department</i>
<i>want to replace the entire system?</i>

433
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:38,320
<i>I only believe in facts.</i>

434
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,920
<i>Can you explain why you were there?</i>

435
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:41,440
<i>Were you involved in this?</i>

436
00:26:41,520 --> 00:26:43,960
<i>Why does the IT Department</i>
<i>want to replace the entire system?</i>

437
00:26:44,040 --> 00:26:45,800
<i>I only believe in facts.</i>

438
00:26:50,800 --> 00:26:53,160
Miss Xu, are you in the room?

439
00:26:54,200 --> 00:26:55,560
Please answer.

440
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:57,960
Or I'm coming in with the spare key card.

441
00:26:58,920 --> 00:27:01,680
Miss Xu, I'm opening the door!

442
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:07,680
No, no…

443
00:27:13,040 --> 00:27:14,040
Are you okay?

444
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,800
Thanks. I'll take it from here.

445
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:23,840
Could you grab me two sports drinks?

446
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:26,360
-Sure.
-No, no need. I don't need to drink. I…

447
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:27,560
Don't talk for now.

448
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:36,720
Eat this.

449
00:27:38,520 --> 00:27:40,000
I'm really fine. I'm not hungry.

450
00:27:40,760 --> 00:27:41,960
Take it.

451
00:27:44,120 --> 00:27:46,800
The front desk said
you haven't left your room in 48 hours.

452
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:47,760
What have you eaten?

453
00:27:51,040 --> 00:27:52,040
I…

454
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:56,440
I've just been sleeping.

455
00:27:57,040 --> 00:27:58,080
Look at yourself.

456
00:27:58,160 --> 00:27:59,680
You say you've been sleeping?

457
00:27:59,760 --> 00:28:01,280
Are you lying to me or yourself?

458
00:28:08,560 --> 00:28:10,480
You know about the Celestial thing?

459
00:28:12,320 --> 00:28:13,600
The consulting world is small.

460
00:28:14,120 --> 00:28:16,200
The moment I heard it, I called Sha Sha.

461
00:28:16,280 --> 00:28:18,360
And you? Gone MIA again.

462
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:20,920
Not replying to WeChat. Phone off.

463
00:28:21,720 --> 00:28:24,600
I dropped everything
and flew back from Shanghai overnight.

464
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:27,040
Then we hit a thunderstorm
and had an emergency landing in Jinan.

465
00:28:27,120 --> 00:28:28,960
I took the 7 a.m. high-speed train
to get here.

466
00:28:29,040 --> 00:28:30,040
I was worried about you.

467
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:32,120
You came back just for me?

468
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:35,080
Of course.
I didn't even drop my luggage off at home.

469
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:48,880
Go ahead.

470
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:52,840
Whether you want to chew me out
or laugh at me, I'm ready.

471
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:54,480
Why would I laugh at you?

472
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:58,280
Because I'm stupid.

473
00:28:58,880 --> 00:29:01,000
To bury a secret thought
I couldn't share with anyone,

474
00:29:01,080 --> 00:29:02,520
I randomly got a boyfriend.

475
00:29:02,600 --> 00:29:04,920
Then randomly broke up
and got dragged into this.

476
00:29:05,560 --> 00:29:07,360
Now I might even lose my job.

477
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:09,880
My mom's old apartment

478
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:13,760
and my big career dreams
could all be down the drain.

479
00:29:17,320 --> 00:29:19,040
You said you wouldn't laugh at me.

480
00:29:20,520 --> 00:29:21,760
I'm not laughing at you.

481
00:29:22,920 --> 00:29:25,240
I'm happy about that secret thought

482
00:29:25,320 --> 00:29:27,200
you couldn't share with anyone.

483
00:29:28,080 --> 00:29:29,960
-Stop making assumptions.
-I'm not.

484
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:39,240
By the way,
did you see all those WeChat messages

485
00:29:39,320 --> 00:29:40,320
I sent you?

486
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:42,320
Why didn't you reply?

487
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:43,640
That picture…

488
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:48,480
I… I didn't know how to reply.

489
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:51,080
You told me you were
on a business trip somewhere.

490
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:54,880
Anything I said back
would've felt weird, right?

491
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:58,160
Not those. I mean the picture.

492
00:29:58,800 --> 00:29:59,640
What about it?

493
00:30:00,440 --> 00:30:01,760
You… Look again.

494
00:30:03,880 --> 00:30:05,800
Seriously. Just look.

495
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:15,600
"The moonlight is beautiful tonight."

496
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:16,760
What about it?

497
00:30:21,080 --> 00:30:22,280
You don't get it?

498
00:30:23,040 --> 00:30:24,160
-What…
-What am I

499
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:25,680
supposed to get?

500
00:30:25,760 --> 00:30:28,560
Wait… I… I specifically
picked that one. You…

501
00:30:30,320 --> 00:30:33,560
I specially picked that one.
I figured young people would get it.

502
00:30:40,560 --> 00:30:42,320
People online say
"The moonlight is beautiful tonight"

503
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:43,920
is another way of saying "I love you."

504
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:56,240
Is that okay?

505
00:30:58,720 --> 00:31:01,760
THE MOONLIGHT IS BEAUTIFUL TONIGHT

506
00:31:10,720 --> 00:31:11,920
And the breeze is gentle.

507
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:16,880
I wanted to take it slow.

508
00:31:18,040 --> 00:31:19,200
But

509
00:31:19,760 --> 00:31:21,280
I'm scared to let go now.

510
00:31:21,360 --> 00:31:22,960
Because once I do…

511
00:31:33,120 --> 00:31:35,720
So, are we still stuck
in the grey between black and white?

512
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:39,920
It's red.

513
00:31:41,920 --> 00:31:43,040
The red of my heart racing for you.

514
00:32:14,280 --> 00:32:15,280
DU

515
00:32:25,040 --> 00:32:28,040
Oh no. I've got a meeting with Du soon.

516
00:32:28,120 --> 00:32:29,560
-I gotta go.
-Go ahead.

517
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:32,200
Why don't you come help me out?

518
00:32:32,280 --> 00:32:33,280
You're on leave anyway.

519
00:32:33,360 --> 00:32:35,400
The project with Wen Ruosen
is wrapping up.

520
00:32:35,920 --> 00:32:37,880
With you there, it'd be easier on me.

521
00:32:41,280 --> 00:32:43,160
Is that okay with my situation?

522
00:32:44,280 --> 00:32:45,560
Should be fine.

523
00:32:46,080 --> 00:32:49,120
Besides, doing a little private work
for your boyfriend…

524
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:01,760
What did you say?

525
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:05,160
I said

526
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:07,760
you're on leave anyway.

527
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:11,560
Doing a little private work
for your boyfriend should be fine.

528
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:15,760
If you're really worried,
you can go ask Sha Sha.

529
00:33:16,360 --> 00:33:19,160
Get some rest for now.
See you at the apartment at eight tonight.

530
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,440
I'm heading out.

531
00:33:28,280 --> 00:33:29,400
Wait.

532
00:33:41,680 --> 00:33:42,840
You…

533
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:46,440
You didn't suddenly say all this

534
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:48,800
just to comfort me, did you?

535
00:33:50,280 --> 00:33:51,120
Do I look like that kind of guy?

536
00:33:58,880 --> 00:34:00,160
I always thought

537
00:34:01,200 --> 00:34:03,160
a mature guy like you

538
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:05,600
wouldn't go for a kid like me.

539
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:12,520
I kept saying

540
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:15,000
we were just master and protege.

541
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:18,600
Because I was terrified
you'd look down on my past.

542
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:22,960
Because love makes people insecure.

543
00:34:24,199 --> 00:34:25,040
It makes me a coward.

544
00:34:34,040 --> 00:34:35,880
I've got plenty of courage.
Let me share some with you.

545
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:41,400
Okay. Go to your meeting. Careful.

546
00:34:55,679 --> 00:34:57,640
The moonlight is beautiful tonight!

547
00:35:00,640 --> 00:35:01,880
<i>And the breeze is gentle.</i>

548
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:09,120
DELIVERIES, PLEASE LEAVE AT DOOR
TABLE ON THE LEFT

549
00:35:18,040 --> 00:35:19,720
<i>NO ONE APPLAUDS</i>

550
00:35:19,800 --> 00:35:22,160
Our project has already entered
the delivery phase.

551
00:35:22,240 --> 00:35:23,800
The highlight of this week's delivery

552
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:25,480
is the overseas business matrix system

553
00:35:25,560 --> 00:35:26,960
we designed for Bolo Culture.

554
00:35:27,720 --> 00:35:28,880
Lin Long is the expert on this.

555
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:31,080
For the next two days,

556
00:35:31,160 --> 00:35:32,200
she'll be conducting

557
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:34,680
an overseas business management training
for the executive team.

558
00:35:39,400 --> 00:35:41,400
We meet again, everyone.

559
00:35:44,640 --> 00:35:46,480
BOLO CULTURE OVERSEAS
BUSINESS MATRIX SYSTEM

560
00:36:10,920 --> 00:36:12,280
What a coincidence.

561
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:15,280
It was Ms. Lin last time too,
and everything went wrong then too.

562
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:16,840
Think she'll pull it off this time?

563
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:18,520
I don't know if she's up for it,

564
00:36:18,600 --> 00:36:21,720
but she's been at it forever
and can't even get the screen to work.

565
00:36:21,800 --> 00:36:23,360
If it were me,
I'd have fired her ages ago.

566
00:36:25,520 --> 00:36:27,080
If you're gonna gossip,
at least keep it down.

567
00:36:27,160 --> 00:36:29,080
-Yes.
-Aren't you afraid of being overheard?

568
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:31,480
Let me tell you,

569
00:36:31,560 --> 00:36:33,200
there are plenty
of Maxmise people here now.

570
00:36:33,280 --> 00:36:34,880
They bill by the hour.

571
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,880
If they hear you and get pissed off

572
00:36:36,960 --> 00:36:38,400
and drag things out
an hour or two every day,

573
00:36:38,480 --> 00:36:39,840
who's paying for that?

574
00:36:44,280 --> 00:36:46,360
Your snack? I'll buy you a new pack.

575
00:36:47,560 --> 00:36:49,720
-Alright. Finish up and get back.
-Okay.

576
00:36:52,560 --> 00:36:53,400
I'll buy you a new pack.

577
00:36:54,240 --> 00:36:55,360
BOLO CULTURE OVERSEAS
BUSINESS MATRIX SYSTEM

578
00:36:55,440 --> 00:36:56,520
Finally.

579
00:36:56,600 --> 00:36:58,520
I'll go tell them
to come in for the meeting.

580
00:36:58,600 --> 00:37:01,200
Sit down and rest.
I'll have Ou Lizheng get them for you.

581
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:02,640
No need to help me. I can do it myself.

582
00:37:02,720 --> 00:37:03,920
I'm not trying to help you.

583
00:37:04,680 --> 00:37:07,120
I just need you at your best,
so you don't embarrass me.

584
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:09,880
You know what?
I asked to have you assigned to me

585
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:10,920
when you came back.

586
00:37:11,600 --> 00:37:12,600
I just wanted to see

587
00:37:12,680 --> 00:37:15,000
how thrilling it feels
to have my old rival

588
00:37:15,080 --> 00:37:15,920
working under me.

589
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:18,280
Not as thrilling

590
00:37:18,360 --> 00:37:20,240
as the feeling of kicking
my ex-husband to the curb.

591
00:37:21,240 --> 00:37:22,600
Not bad. You've got some fight.

592
00:37:22,680 --> 00:37:23,680
You know what?

593
00:37:23,760 --> 00:37:25,920
These past few months
have been pretty lonely

594
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:27,080
without anyone giving me pushback.

595
00:37:32,320 --> 00:37:34,960
-What?
-I want to thank you.

596
00:37:35,040 --> 00:37:36,720
Thank you for letting me
back on this project.

597
00:37:38,120 --> 00:37:39,680
Cut it out.

598
00:37:39,760 --> 00:37:42,160
The guys at the office
are just waiting for you to fail.

599
00:37:42,240 --> 00:37:44,160
I'm not letting them steal
my exclusive rights.

600
00:37:44,920 --> 00:37:47,760
You've got half an hour.
I'll hold down the fort for you.

601
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:52,840
Go touch up your lipstick.

602
00:38:21,640 --> 00:38:24,000
Why did you bring
so much makeup to work here?

603
00:38:24,080 --> 00:38:26,160
You look the same with or without it.

604
00:38:26,240 --> 00:38:27,080
Why are you sneaking up
on people like that?

605
00:38:27,160 --> 00:38:28,400
I was just…

606
00:38:32,040 --> 00:38:34,360
Are you fully recovered?
What's the rush to get back to work?

607
00:38:35,360 --> 00:38:37,560
Thanks for your concern, Mr. Shen.
I've been fine for a while now.

608
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:40,360
Who are you kidding?

609
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:41,760
Look at you.

610
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:43,120
You're thin as a rail.

611
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:44,800
Want some spicy strips?

612
00:38:46,120 --> 00:38:48,320
-Mr. Shen, let's just go to the meeting--
-Hold on.

613
00:38:49,080 --> 00:38:50,400
I'm the client.

614
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:53,440
I'm paying you for consulting.
I'm not in a rush, so why are you?

615
00:38:55,120 --> 00:38:56,280
I just wanted to say,

616
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:58,720
if you haven't fully recovered,
don't rush back to work.

617
00:38:59,520 --> 00:39:00,800
Why push yourself?

618
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:02,920
Just wing it during the training later.

619
00:39:03,680 --> 00:39:05,080
Just send us the slides afterward.

620
00:39:06,600 --> 00:39:08,120
Mr. Shen, do you think

621
00:39:08,200 --> 00:39:10,320
I've been coasting in consulting

622
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:11,920
all these years?

623
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:13,920
I'll admit I wasn't
professional enough before.

624
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:16,840
That's because my hormones
were out of whack during pregnancy.

625
00:39:16,920 --> 00:39:18,120
But now that I'm back,

626
00:39:18,200 --> 00:39:19,480
I'm going to do it right.

627
00:39:20,280 --> 00:39:23,920
I was just expressing my concern for you.

628
00:39:24,720 --> 00:39:26,640
Purely out of sympathy.

629
00:39:26,720 --> 00:39:27,720
Sympathy?

630
00:39:27,800 --> 00:39:30,440
When you fail, do you want people
to comfort you with sympathy?

631
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:33,680
What's wrong with you?

632
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:36,120
I try to be nice,
and you throw it back in my face.

633
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:48,840
-What?
-I wanted to thank you

634
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:51,680
for taking me to the clinic
after my car accident

635
00:39:51,760 --> 00:39:53,040
and for

636
00:39:53,120 --> 00:39:55,080
checking on me just now.

637
00:39:56,680 --> 00:39:57,520
And this.

638
00:39:59,600 --> 00:40:01,000
Xu Chi brought this to me before.

639
00:40:01,600 --> 00:40:03,560
She said you specifically asked for it.
And she passed along that message.

640
00:40:04,600 --> 00:40:06,560
"A rebirth through hardship
and better days ahead."

641
00:40:06,640 --> 00:40:08,360
I've had my share of hardship.

642
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:09,880
Now it's time to earn those better days

643
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:11,600
with my own two hands.

644
00:40:15,640 --> 00:40:17,280
Just keep it. No need to give it back.

645
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:21,680
Then I'll just sit back
and watch you do your thing.

646
00:40:22,640 --> 00:40:24,120
But let's get one thing straight.

647
00:40:24,200 --> 00:40:25,960
If you don't do a good job,

648
00:40:26,040 --> 00:40:27,880
I'll still have your company replace you.

649
00:40:29,120 --> 00:40:30,920
-No problem.
-Alright.

650
00:40:31,680 --> 00:40:32,560
Get back in there.

651
00:40:37,720 --> 00:40:38,920
Wait.

652
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:42,200
Let me make one thing clear.

653
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:44,480
I didn't specifically
get that thing for you.

654
00:40:45,080 --> 00:40:46,560
Everyone in our company has one.

655
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:48,840
I get it.

656
00:40:49,520 --> 00:40:50,520
And…

657
00:40:53,160 --> 00:40:54,240
I meant what I said.

658
00:40:54,320 --> 00:40:55,800
You look good

659
00:40:58,520 --> 00:40:59,400
with or without makeup.

660
00:41:04,480 --> 00:41:06,840
Our first question
covers three main areas.

661
00:41:06,920 --> 00:41:10,040
Revenue forecast,
cost structure, and break-even.

662
00:41:10,120 --> 00:41:11,080
Everyone can take a look.

663
00:41:11,160 --> 00:41:13,760
Feel free to ask
if you have any questions.

664
00:41:14,680 --> 00:41:16,680
Ms. Lin, based on Maxmise's analysis,

665
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:18,040
what's the biggest pain point

666
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:19,760
and challenge in the HR integration

667
00:41:19,840 --> 00:41:21,800
between Bolo and Qingyi?

668
00:41:22,880 --> 00:41:24,920
The biggest challenge is that

669
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:26,040
getting married is easy,
but living together is hard.

670
00:41:26,640 --> 00:41:28,320
Let me use a familiar romance drama

671
00:41:28,400 --> 00:41:29,480
as an example.

672
00:41:29,560 --> 00:41:31,720
Bolo is like a career-driven CEO

673
00:41:31,800 --> 00:41:33,080
who lives and breathes KPIs.

674
00:41:33,160 --> 00:41:35,720
And Qingyi is like an artistic girl

675
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:37,200
who meditates for three minutes
before every meeting.

676
00:41:37,280 --> 00:41:39,080
Put two people like that
under the same roof

677
00:41:39,160 --> 00:41:41,320
after marriage, and the trouble starts.

678
00:41:42,120 --> 00:41:43,720
Like, after using the bathroom,

679
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:45,760
should the toilet seat stay up or down?

680
00:41:49,400 --> 00:41:51,040
Of course, that's just a metaphor.

681
00:41:51,120 --> 00:41:53,840
The book value of a merger
is written in the financials.

682
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:55,880
But the real value
is hidden in the everyday conversations

683
00:41:55,960 --> 00:41:56,920
between organizations.

684
00:41:57,000 --> 00:41:59,000
Maxmise's job is to help Bolo and Qingyi

685
00:41:59,080 --> 00:42:01,360
find a new organization
despite their differences.

686
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:04,080
She's good to go.

687
00:42:08,200 --> 00:42:11,560
How are things on the Celestial side?
She was just asking about Xu Chi.

688
00:42:13,040 --> 00:42:14,520
I can go back to work next week.

689
00:42:14,600 --> 00:42:15,920
As for Celestial…

690
00:42:17,280 --> 00:42:18,920
Ma Ke and Celestial's IT director

691
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:20,520
are still blaming each other.

692
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:22,800
The investigation
won't wrap up anytime soon.

693
00:42:52,680 --> 00:42:54,000
What?

694
00:42:56,880 --> 00:42:58,680
I…

695
00:43:00,040 --> 00:43:02,240
The painting behind you is really nice.
I just took a photo.

696
00:43:14,560 --> 00:43:15,480
What are you doing?

697
00:43:16,760 --> 00:43:17,880
The flowers behind you are nice too.

698
00:43:18,560 --> 00:43:19,640
I'm taking a photo.

699
00:43:23,080 --> 00:43:24,360
Let me see.

700
00:43:25,280 --> 00:43:26,520
Let me see what you took.

701
00:43:27,920 --> 00:43:29,800
-No!
-It looks great.

702
00:43:29,880 --> 00:43:33,640
No! Send it to me.
My face looks so puffy in this.

703
00:43:33,720 --> 00:43:35,400
Look at mine.
Look at the one I took of you.

704
00:43:36,520 --> 00:43:38,040
Look what I took for you.

705
00:43:38,640 --> 00:43:40,920
You gotta send me that one.
I need to edit it.

706
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:42,200
You really take good photos.

707
00:43:42,280 --> 00:43:43,520
Okay, I'll send it to you.

708
00:43:49,400 --> 00:43:50,600
Let's get down to business.

709
00:43:51,120 --> 00:43:54,200
You had me gathering market data
on digital collectibles for so long.

710
00:43:54,280 --> 00:43:56,040
What are you planning to do to Wen Ruosen?
